        },
        {
          "text": "Jugorcik kucel ku Jufarisayo gilund giloko lembe ire, giwacu kumae, Japonji, wayenyo wanen giranyutha i beng’i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.12.38",
